  "draft_py": "# Abrade (FDN) -- Choose one --\n#  * Abrade deals 3 damage to target creature.     (Turn to Slag's B5c-turn-to-slag atom, 3)\n#  * Destroy target artifact.                       (compiled bullet, kept)\n# Modal shape: M21 Destructive Tampering / M20 Reckless Air Strike's Choose(count 1).\nabilities = [\n    SpellAbility(\n        kind=SpellKind.INSTANT,\n        effect=Choose(\n            count=QConst(value=1),\n            options=(\n                A(Verb.DEAL_DAMAGE, {\n                    'amount': QConst(value=3),\n                    'target': Selector(\n                        count=QConst(value=1),\n                        mode=SelectorMode.TARGET,\n                        filter=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n                        zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n                    ),\n                }),\n                compiled[0].effect,\n            ),\n        ),\n    ),\n]\n",
